@startuml
left to right direction
hide private members
hide public methods
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E5D8A
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8D6

class User {
  + id : UUID
  - passwordHash : String
  + signIn() : Session
  - rotateSecret()
}
class Session {
  + expiresAt : Instant
}

User --> Session : starts
note bottom of User : private state remains hidden
@enduml
